{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535790680,"sessionID":"ses_e2d59c2caffe5HQ2ihlCR2l4Mg","part":{"id":"prt_1d2ab03fe002rqFryt5ytNEf9t","sessionID":"ses_e2d59c2caffe5HQ2ihlCR2l4Mg","messageID":"msg_1d2aae618001QT7Uqmyofi69C4","type":"text","text":"T022 is complete. I added the status cases to the named test file only, and did not tick the checkbox.\n\n## Files written\n\n`/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts`\n\n- Added a hoisted `vi.mock` for `lib/embedders/adapters/ollama.js`, overriding only `probeOllamaModel` and `resolveOllamaBaseUrl` (the handler's only network probe), with a `beforeEach` reset.\n- Added `writeCommandVectorTable` fixture helper creating `vec_cmd_768` with N rows.\n- Added five cases:\n  - `commandVectorCoverage` with no `vec_cmd_<dim>` table → `embedded: 0`, `total` equal to `readCommandEmbeddingSources()` length.\n  - `commandVectorCoverage` with `vec_cmd_768` → `embedded: 3`, same total.\n  - `backend` reachable, asserting the probe call is `('http://127.0.0.1:11434', 'nomic-embed-text:v1.5', 500)` and `laneEnabled` stays true.\n  - `backend` unreachable → state `unreachable`, `laneEnabled` false.\n  - `backend` model missing → state `model_missing`, `laneEnabled` false.\n\n## Verify output\n\nCommand (from `$ADV`): `npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts`\n\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  27 passed (27)\n   Start at  03:08:39\n   Duration  434ms (transform 207ms, setup 13ms, import 290ms, tests 71ms, environment 0ms)\n```\n\nBaseline was 22 passing in this file (`rg -c \"^  it\\(\"` on the pre-edit working copy and on `HEAD`), so the run is 5 more passed and 0 failed, meeting the task's bar.\n\nSupporting check: `npm --prefix $ADV run typecheck` also exits 0. `rg` for task/spec/ADR markers in the edited file returns no matches. Nothing was committed or staged, and no other file was touched.","time":{"start":1794535785470,"end":1794535790680}}}
